{"code":0,"msg":"获取成功","time":"2026-09-17 18:02:43","data":{"id":"cd2e9a24-3145-f279-477d-c5389a5dc11c","com_id":"05f92afa-6c8f-50f6-4a11-1c7448d995a6","job_id":"cdcac609-c8fb-0438-8fc9-892885e3328d","school_id":"1917e634-eee1-1358-537d-7e36f6f41777","addtime":1789347648,"istop":2,"complaint":0,"resume_count":0,"work_name":"中信证券陕西分公司-2027校招培训生","schoolwarn":"请各位同学在求职时提高警惕，凡涉及收取各种费用；几乎不面试就给出录取通知，且到外地就职的招聘等情况，要仔细辨别，谨防上当受骗。","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\" align=\"center\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">中信证券股份有限公司<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">陕西分公司<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\" align=\"center\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">2027年校园招聘简章<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">一、公司简介<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">中信证券股份有限公司（简称<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">“中信证券”，A股代码“600030”、H股代码“6030”）成立于1995年10月，2003年在上海证券交易所挂牌上市交易，2011年在香港联合交易所挂牌上市交易，是中国第一家A+H股上市的证券公司。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">中信证券业务范围涵盖证券、基金、期货、外汇和大宗商品等多个领域，通过全牌照综合金融服务，全方位支持实体经济发展，为国内外企业客户、机构客户、高净值客户、零售客户提供各类金融服务解决方案。目前拥有<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">6家主要独立业务子公司，分支机构遍布全球13个国家，中国境内分支机构和网点400余家，华夏基金、中信期货、中信金石投资、中信证券资管等主要控股子公司均在各自领域中保持领先地位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2025年末，中信证券总资产20,819亿元，归属母公司净资产3,199亿元。2025年实现营业收入748.54亿元，归属母公司净利润300.76亿元，均稳居行业领先地位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">二、招聘计划安排<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（一）招聘需求<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.招聘机构：<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">陕西分公司<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.工作地点：<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西安市、西咸新区、宝鸡市、榆林市<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（二）招聘对象<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">有志于从事证券行业、服务实体经济，面向<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2026年下半年至2027年上半年期间毕业的境内外本科及以上学历的应届毕业生（以学位证\/教育部留学服务中心认证的毕业时间为准）。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（三）岗位介绍<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.岗位名称：培训生<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.岗位职责：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">专注进行证券投资相关的客户开发与服务、金融产品销售以及其他投融资和资本中介业务，为全球客户提供财富保值增值的全方位金融服务。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.任职要求：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1）本科及以上学历应届毕业生；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2）热爱证券行业，具备良好的人际交往能力，喜欢主动与他人建立联系并进行分享交流；能够系统快速地掌握新知识，并加以运用；乐于团队协作，善于运用多种方式促成结果达成；追求卓越，自驱力强，面对目标坚持不懈；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3）具备良好的职业道德与专业素质，已通过证券、基金等从业资格考试优先。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（四）招聘流程<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">各环节于<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2026年9月至2027年4月滚动进行<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.宣讲与网申<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">候选人可登录中信证券股份有限公司官网，网申投递简历；或选择扫描二维码进入移动端进行快速投递。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.简历筛选<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">各分（子）公司根据应聘者综合背景与应聘岗位的匹配度进行初步筛选。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.在线测评与面试<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">对于符合岗位任职基本要求的应聘者，需参加各分（子）公司组织的在线测评与面试考察。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">4.实习考察<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">通过甄选流程的应聘者，进入分（子）公司或营业部内进行实习。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">5.发放录用通知<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">录用审批通过后，将收到电子签版的录用通知。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（五）申请方式<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">有意者请登陆中信证券招聘官网（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">http:\/\/ careers.citics.com）加入我们-2027年分支机构校园招聘，进行在线申请。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">或扫描下方二维码在线申请：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><img src=\"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2026\/09\/14\/1789347632-911db4ebfb-e672-b6fe-b6ab-03481443a41c.png!y\" alt=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（六）申请注意事项<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.推荐使用IE、Chrome、Firefox等浏览器登录进行网申。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.每位应聘者限投2个岗位，以本人有效身份证件号码（中国大陆居民必须使用身份证号码）为准，多投岗位无效。完成岗位应聘后，将无法更改应聘岗位，务必谨慎操作。岗位投递前注意区分招聘分支机构、工作地点和招聘岗位，慎重选择应聘岗位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.我司会通过短信、电话、邮件等方式通知面试和实习安排，请确保您填写的手机号码准确并保持畅通状态，且手机号码必须是中国大陆的运营商（中国移动、中国联通、中国电信）；邮箱推荐使用163、126邮箱；不建议使用edu后缀、gmail、QQ等邮箱，以免出现邮件通知退信或拦截的情况。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">4.应聘者应对申请资料信息的真实性负责，如与事实不符，我司有权取消其应聘资格。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">5.我司从未成立或委托成立任何考试中心、命题中心等机构或类似机构，从未编辑或出版过任何招聘考试参考资料，从未向任何机构提供过招聘考试相关的资料和信息。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">6.我司从未委托任何机构及个人以中介形式内部推荐全职工作，公司招聘官网为本次校园招聘简历接收的唯一官方渠道。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">7.中信证券股份有限公司对本次校园招聘享有最终解释权。<\/span><\/span><\/p>","isdeliver":1,"status":1,"jobInfo":{"id":"cdcac609-c8fb-0438-8fc9-892885e3328d","jobtype":1,"work_name":"中信证券陕西分公司-2027校招培训生","dalei_id":"64bf4dfe-f3d8-82df-2868-33ab5c672df3","cate_id1":"107a935e-6daf-04b8-8e50-d853305f0485","cate_id2":"cc59b444-e4cc-4e2d-103d-cd9424b4cb5f","province_id":61,"city_id":6101,"district_id":0,"isday":0,"salary_floor":15000,"salay_ceil":19999,"status":1,"create_id":"776e306a-aa9c-823c-715d-ca2c0139d15f","addtime":1789347638,"person_count":"30人","com_id":"05f92afa-6c8f-50f6-4a11-1c7448d995a6","com_id_name":"中信证券股份有限公司陕西分公司","label":"","xueli_id":"3cc6e5cf-0b81-7e83-8322-fe0273871ab0","laiyuan":2,"sharetype":0,"viewcount":33,"complaint":0,"work_days":"","practice_month":"","chance":3,"isedit":2,"resume_count":0,"expire_time":0,"address":"陕西省西安市雁塔区唐延路禾盛京广中心A座国寿金融中心19层","start_time":0,"end_time":0,"teacher_business":"","refresh_time":0,"is_del":2,"is_expire":1,"exposure":0,"wm_id":null,"certificate":"","job_id":"cdcac609-c8fb-0438-8fc9-892885e3328d","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\" align=\"center\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">中信证券股份有限公司<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">陕西分公司<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\" align=\"center\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体; font-size: 22.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 方正小标宋简体;\">2027年校园招聘简章<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">一、公司简介<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">中信证券股份有限公司（简称<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">“中信证券”，A股代码“600030”、H股代码“6030”）成立于1995年10月，2003年在上海证券交易所挂牌上市交易，2011年在香港联合交易所挂牌上市交易，是中国第一家A+H股上市的证券公司。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">中信证券业务范围涵盖证券、基金、期货、外汇和大宗商品等多个领域，通过全牌照综合金融服务，全方位支持实体经济发展，为国内外企业客户、机构客户、高净值客户、零售客户提供各类金融服务解决方案。目前拥有<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">6家主要独立业务子公司，分支机构遍布全球13个国家，中国境内分支机构和网点400余家，华夏基金、中信期货、中信金石投资、中信证券资管等主要控股子公司均在各自领域中保持领先地位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2025年末，中信证券总资产20,819亿元，归属母公司净资产3,199亿元。2025年实现营业收入748.54亿元，归属母公司净利润300.76亿元，均稳居行业领先地位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">二、招聘计划安排<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（一）招聘需求<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.招聘机构：<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">陕西分公司<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.工作地点：<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西安市、西咸新区、宝鸡市、榆林市<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（二）招聘对象<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">有志于从事证券行业、服务实体经济，面向<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2026年下半年至2027年上半年期间毕业的境内外本科及以上学历的应届毕业生（以学位证\/教育部留学服务中心认证的毕业时间为准）。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（三）岗位介绍<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.岗位名称：培训生<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.岗位职责：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">专注进行证券投资相关的客户开发与服务、金融产品销售以及其他投融资和资本中介业务，为全球客户提供财富保值增值的全方位金融服务。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.任职要求：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1）本科及以上学历应届毕业生；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2）热爱证券行业，具备良好的人际交往能力，喜欢主动与他人建立联系并进行分享交流；能够系统快速地掌握新知识，并加以运用；乐于团队协作，善于运用多种方式促成结果达成；追求卓越，自驱力强，面对目标坚持不懈；<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3）具备良好的职业道德与专业素质，已通过证券、基金等从业资格考试优先。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（四）招聘流程<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">各环节于<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2026年9月至2027年4月滚动进行<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.宣讲与网申<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">候选人可登录中信证券股份有限公司官网，网申投递简历；或选择扫描二维码进入移动端进行快速投递。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.简历筛选<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">各分（子）公司根据应聘者综合背景与应聘岗位的匹配度进行初步筛选。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.在线测评与面试<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">对于符合岗位任职基本要求的应聘者，需参加各分（子）公司组织的在线测评与面试考察。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">4.实习考察<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">通过甄选流程的应聘者，进入分（子）公司或营业部内进行实习。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">5.发放录用通知<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">录用审批通过后，将收到电子签版的录用通知。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（五）申请方式<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">有意者请登陆中信证券招聘官网（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">http:\/\/ careers.citics.com）加入我们-2027年分支机构校园招聘，进行在线申请。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">或扫描下方二维码在线申请：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\"><img src=\"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2026\/09\/14\/1789347632-911db4ebfb-e672-b6fe-b6ab-03481443a41c.png!y\" alt=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（六）申请注意事项<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.推荐使用IE、Chrome、Firefox等浏览器登录进行网申。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.每位应聘者限投2个岗位，以本人有效身份证件号码（中国大陆居民必须使用身份证号码）为准，多投岗位无效。完成岗位应聘后，将无法更改应聘岗位，务必谨慎操作。岗位投递前注意区分招聘分支机构、工作地点和招聘岗位，慎重选择应聘岗位。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.我司会通过短信、电话、邮件等方式通知面试和实习安排，请确保您填写的手机号码准确并保持畅通状态，且手机号码必须是中国大陆的运营商（中国移动、中国联通、中国电信）；邮箱推荐使用163、126邮箱；不建议使用edu后缀、gmail、QQ等邮箱，以免出现邮件通知退信或拦截的情况。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">4.应聘者应对申请资料信息的真实性负责，如与事实不符，我司有权取消其应聘资格。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">5.我司从未成立或委托成立任何考试中心、命题中心等机构或类似机构，从未编辑或出版过任何招聘考试参考资料，从未向任何机构提供过招聘考试相关的资料和信息。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">6.我司从未委托任何机构及个人以中介形式内部推荐全职工作，公司招聘官网为本次校园招聘简历接收的唯一官方渠道。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">7.中信证券股份有限公司对本次校园招聘享有最终解释权。<\/span><\/span><\/p>","tags":"0b262f4b-5e46-500b-2482-754072c32816,25f80026-ba06-65df-f26c-10966dec5da1,3f8c70db-16e5-9c8c-6a5d-e73d00d4110f,b6f06ed5-8290-c926-b0db-ecf506891b56,d6bf4589-2b0f-cc1d-7ff0-bfe056cf31e4","create_name":"","zhize":"","fangxiang":"","tagsList":[{"id":"0b262f4b-5e46-500b-2482-754072c32816","title":"国有央企"},{"id":"25f80026-ba06-65df-f26c-10966dec5da1","title":"六险一金双休"},{"id":"3f8c70db-16e5-9c8c-6a5d-e73d00d4110f","title":"带薪年假"},{"id":"b6f06ed5-8290-c926-b0db-ecf506891b56","title":"周末双休"},{"id":"d6bf4589-2b0f-cc1d-7ff0-bfe056cf31e4","title":"行业前三甲"}],"address_extend":"","dalei_id_name":"金融业务人员","cate_id1_name":"证券\/金融\/投资类","cate_id2_name":"证券\/期货\/黄金\/外汇经纪人","province_id_name":"陕西省","city_id_name":"西安市","com_id_info":{"logo":"dd019d7c-2ecf-73f6-8788-a6ea82d3342f","name":"中信证券股份有限公司陕西分公司","hy_vip":0,"hy_over_time":0,"xingzhi_id":"141950e4-d0ec-4f7e-be9c-4d7b8ccb2606","business":"1414b90b-95db-95c3-e00a-d4ce6370fb08","tag":"国有企业","tagsid":["fcc9277c-1629-d435-560f-21a3d55d7290"],"addtime":1571228070,"resumeCount":21,"business_name":"金融业","business_code":"35","xingzhi_id_name":"国有企业","xingzhi_id_code":"31","logo_src":"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2025\/09\/10\/1757468243-93e0b4ebf1-7d40-acdf-77ff-91071b514299.png","status1":"新注册","is_vip":0},"com_logo_src":"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2025\/09\/10\/1757468243-93e0b4ebf1-7d40-acdf-77ff-91071b514299.png","xingzhi_id_name":"国有企业","business_name":"金融业","xueli_id_name":"本科","chance_name":"面议"},"province_id_name":"暂无","school_id_name":"西北大学","school_id_code":10697,"com_id_info":{"logo":"dd019d7c-2ecf-73f6-8788-a6ea82d3342f","name":"中信证券股份有限公司陕西分公司","hy_vip":0,"hy_over_time":0,"xingzhi_id":"141950e4-d0ec-4f7e-be9c-4d7b8ccb2606","business":"1414b90b-95db-95c3-e00a-d4ce6370fb08","tag":"国有企业","tagsid":["fcc9277c-1629-d435-560f-21a3d55d7290"],"addtime":1571228070,"resumeCount":21,"business_name":"金融业","business_code":"35","xingzhi_id_name":"国有企业","xingzhi_id_code":"31","logo_src":"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2025\/09\/10\/1757468243-93e0b4ebf1-7d40-acdf-77ff-91071b514299.png","status1":"新注册","is_vip":0},"com_logo_src":"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2025\/09\/10\/1757468243-93e0b4ebf1-7d40-acdf-77ff-91071b514299.png","com_id_name":"中信证券股份有限公司陕西分公司","xingzhi_id_name":"国有企业","business_name":"金融业","xueli_id_name":"暂无","person_count":"不限","deliver_email":"暂无","comInfo":{"name":"中信证券股份有限公司陕西分公司","logo":"dd019d7c-2ecf-73f6-8788-a6ea82d3342f","business":"1414b90b-95db-95c3-e00a-d4ce6370fb08","guimo_id":"20715d1b-992b-6776-1855-05de0f68b8fa","xingzhi_id":"141950e4-d0ec-4f7e-be9c-4d7b8ccb2606","province":61,"city":6101,"content":"中信证券股份有限公司（简称“中信证券”，A股代码“600030”、H股代码“6030”）成立于1995年，历经二十余载，已成为国际化综合投资银行。\r\n公司目前拥有32个部门及业务线，主要一级子公司7家，人员总数1.8万人。分支机构遍布全球13个国家和地区，全国31个省、市、自治区（不含香港、台湾）。业务范围覆盖证券、基金、期货、直投等领域，各项业务均排名行业前列。2019年末，中信证券总资产7917亿元，归属母公司净资产1616亿元。2019年度公司营业收入431亿元，归属母公司净利润122亿元，均排名市场第一。中信证券在国内市场积累了广泛的声誉和品牌优势，多年来获得亚洲货币、英国金融时报、福布斯、沪深证券交易所等境内外机构颁发的各类奖项。\r\n目前，中信证券在全国范围内经纪业务分支机构超过400家。为全国近百个城市超过1030万客户提供证券经纪、证券投资咨询、融资融券、个股期权以及各类金融产品等综合金融服务解决方案，针对高端客户提供包括家族信托及私人定制财富配置服务。业务发展早已实现业务多元化、网点功能多样化、客户高端化，产品的创设和销售能力在金融机构中具有绝对影响力，整体市场竞争力持续位居行业领先。\r\n中信证券统一客户联络中心在青岛、杭州、西安分设三大中心，为投资者提供线上业务办理、证券交易业务咨询、客户回访等全方位的标准化业务运营服务。统一客户联络中心依托中信证券强大的信息资源和研发优势，不断优化行业领先的客户语音、在线互动平台，持续业务创新，打造证券业卓越的线上业务执行中心。","address":"陕西省西安市雁塔区唐延路禾盛京广中心A座国寿金融中心19层","hy_vip":0,"hy_over_time":0,"tagcomlist":[{"id":"e9037925-c980-93e3-518b-93874b20ee75","com_id":"05f92afa-6c8f-50f6-4a11-1c7448d995a6","tagsid":"fcc9277c-1629-d435-560f-21a3d55d7290","createtype":"com","school_id":"","title":"国有企业"}],"business_name":"金融业","business_code":"35","province_name":"陕西省","city_name":"西安市","guimo_id_name":"1000人以上","guimo_id_code":"","xingzhi_id_name":"国有企业","xingzhi_id_code":"31","logo_src":"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2025\/09\/10\/1757468243-93e0b4ebf1-7d40-acdf-77ff-91071b514299.png","status1":"新注册","is_vip":2},"otherJobList":null,"ProfessionalList":[],"yxdeilver":true,"isDeliver":false,"is_job_complaint":0,"isCollection":false}}